{
      "id": "virtual-campus",
      "name": "3D Virtual Campus",
      "category": "interactive-experiences",
      
      "shortDescription": "A browser-based recreation of my undergraduate campus, connecting explorable classrooms and interiors to live online meetings during COVID.",
      "heroImage": "media/virtual-campus/front.png",
      
      "tools": ["Babylon.js", "Blender", "Substance Designer", "Real-Time 3D"],

      "process": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "I recreated my undergraduate campus as an interactive 3D environment where students could explore familiar spaces, enter rooms, and join the online meetings associated with them. Built during COVID, the project connected remote college activities to the physical places where they would normally happen."
      },

      {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "media/virtual-campus/iso.png",
        "alt": "Isometric"
        
      },

      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "The experience was hosted on the college’s official CDN and endorsed by the director."
      },

      {
        "type": "video",
        "src": "media/virtual-campus/3d_virtual_campus_demo.mp4",
        
        "caption": "Exploring campus"
      },
    
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Built for real-time exploration: Recreating an entire campus required balancing architectural detail with the constraints of browser-based rendering. I baked and optimised assets for real-time use, carrying the environment from its authoring tools into a navigable web experience. Multiple rooms could be entered and explored, making the campus a connected environment with usable interior spaces."
      },


      
      
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "The project brought together environment production, real-time graphics, interaction development, and web deployment in an institutionally supported experience created for the college community."
      }


      
    ],

